{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.061968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de433cd523e34ca238b0666937a30adf8d98ad4fd53853d7ee4a232bd59600c5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition lem:29 of arXiv:2606.28067, 'Ergodic approximation for the invariant distribution: An abstract framework for law-depend'] Suppose  that there exist $\lambda, C>0$ and $r\in {\mathbb N}$  such that for every $\mu \in 
