{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.934985+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de447186a94947e127dfc0ba78c625ff8c434890e55b88ecd472d801e66fd0c2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] Suppose that $\E[\omega_e] = 0$ and $\beta \geq 0$. If almost surely
