{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:53:00.823274+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de586391cec36def41a25ccb0b0358f04545bf4c62a3154295d0f29cc65ea62f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Def: eff leaves of arXiv:2607.18635, 'Remainders of generalised Taylor expansions and a priori bounds for rough differential equ'] The \emph{effective cherries} 
