{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:17:13.063111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de605ff47481e9cad011f1c3e77a99a8d1bcd9323efd5b07917adf73fd888e96","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:Bnset of arXiv:2508.04954, 'Conditional exponential directed last passage percolation under a one-point upper large de'] Define the set  
