{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.362523+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de60cbc7fe1988ea0a8c11dd7d31d26f1a0faf3d3ef0aa3d726983d6f3f9ce1c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 45 of arXiv:2606.17859, 'Full $\Gamma-$expansion for the level-two large deviation rate functionals of non-reversib'] Fix $1\leq p\leq \mf q$. Then, for every $x\in \bb T$
