{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.607717+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de9ae1a3ffe2dfa3c5d869c40003bf2d90882f46c421b7d2e76db3ca26139c61","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 12 of arXiv:2506.08775, 'Markovian multivariate Hawkes population processes: Efficient evaluation of moments'] Under Assumption \ref{ass_sym}, for a random vector $\bm{X}$, we have as $\theta \uparrow 1$
