{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:46:25.314870+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_debff8682c6e5d248674b23d54a6bb315347c45531571e305d83009da78303c4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 757pm of arXiv:2604.12136, 'Integrability of Multispecies Long-Range Swap Models with Species-Dependent Interpolation'] The invertibility of the associated operators holds for the following multisets $M$:
