{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:56:11.135052+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ded627e3dd4251875c3b61b5e454e9042a4b91d98c6b3d1a2c7039e16fa8ea9a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2608.10515, 'Limiting Law of Local Fields for the Mean Field Ghatak-Sherrington Model'] Under the same conditions as in Proposition~\ref{prop:ratio}, we have
