{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:06.323978+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ded6e04308ec1160b56dc5d5bb5200d73bef021c7050504740742688ea952652","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2607.05219, 'Random free semigroups of affine groups'] Let $r$ be the free   rank of $A$. Then 
