{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.304091+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df1e1a64d777b01b590eedfda61f4bce15612bbad76cdb67099fb1715dd635ad","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 49 of arXiv:2510.22155, 'Random walks in space-time random media in all spatial dimensions: the full subcritical fl'] Let $d \geq 1$ and consider the setting of Assumption \ref{ass:SRI}.
