{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:27.577868+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df319b8b4e48a8631a48e2d23d7274944eb12f9f5886d8020995edbf652df15f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Def 41 of arXiv:2510.23423, 'One-arm exponents of the high-dimensional Ising model'] Let $\n\in \Omega_{G_\fg}$ and $x,y\in V_\fg$.
