{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.869784+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df539bf9f0252a02ac144cfa3ef383e88cf46a095e2c61497794bbf71c5ea68d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:cdtn-proper-zcoup of arXiv:2605.10491, 'Zero-couplings of infinite measures with cyclically monotone support and multivariate regu'] Let $\mu, \nu \in \mathrm{M}_{0}(\mathbb{R}^d)$ and assume
    \begin{equation}

