{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.037686+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df907ee0f35c21b10c39127c1295364a55b45a09c83ce409d10e1cde8047c852","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2-l11 of arXiv:2412.04015, 'Linear fluctuation of interfaces in Glauber-Kawasaki dynamics'] Fix a function $G\colon {\mathbb R}_+ \times {\mathbb T}^{d}_N \to {\mathbb R}$. Then,
