{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.708251+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dff9d78c45a4e9084ab827ec05666b88a41072095a65138d11a69f54d3affb8b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop main term being probability of arXiv:2605.29095, 'Asymptotics of the number of components of random polynomial lemniscates'] Let $O_n$ be the event defined in (equation definition of O_n of the paper) and $S_n$ be the random walk defined in (equation def of S_n and S_n hat of the paper). Then, 
