Then there exist $c,c_{1},c_{2}>0$, such that
\begin{equation}
c_{1}\mathrm{dist}(S,T)^{-2}2^{-2n}\leq\widetilde{\mathbb{P}}_{n}(T\in\mathfrak{S}_{n}|\mathscr{F}_{j-1})\leq c_{2}\mathrm{dist}(S,T)^{-2}2^{-2n},
\end{equation}
and
\begin{equation}
