{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.669065+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0849bb0949b63fc0ae2a0449c0b8e112efff2608d9993fe26131ed82c12038a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 (Uniform fixed surplus Wright bound) of arXiv:2608.04799, '2608.04799'] For every integer \(R_0\ge0\), there is \(C=C(R_0)<\infty\) such that
