{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.581558+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e08528f24874e7dc0dd46282ce1f369fbcc2945cbe9edab5b4c051ed72a270e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemmaexitright of arXiv:2608.30443, 'On smooth holosphere solutions to compressible Euler equation'] Pick universal constants $\frac{1}{\delta},\Theta^*\gg1 $ large enough as in Lemma (propositionfundamental of the paper), then  for all $0<b<b^*(\Theta^*,\delta)$ small enough and $\alpha_\gamma$ given by 
