{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:26:02.394063+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e08d4931f58f65458e128367b5ac871e413be21f954390b2e5dd9665a67135ef","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem nec_hyp of arXiv:2608.30031, 'Ziggurats, taut foliations, and contact structures'] \begin{enumerate}
