{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.131792+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e08f4207e073422f0843df004ecc4bc07ebaa7646ef3fa90e13a4e2065f85e03","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 20 ({\cite[Theorem 14.17) of arXiv:2608.27450, 'Koszul duality and Morita categories'] {heuts2024koszulduality}}] 
