{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:02.014771+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0ca01f5d3b6a2a44d8fe2ac9a7f4186e0981c266d47b27fe7e1e58e406d1b22","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LEM:OUdec of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Let $L_\varepsilon=\varepsilon^{-\frac 12+\eta}$ and $ \min_{ \ell \neq i}|\xi_\ell-\xi_i | \ge d_\varepsilon= \big|\log  (\varepsilon \log \frac 1 \varepsilon) \big|$. 

