{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.990775+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0f021feff4bc12dcdcc0fcac8d04a1da4e67a70656553df9670bf9bd73fba60","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 18 of arXiv:2604.00882, 'On some extensions of generalized counting processes'] The probabilities ${\tilde p}_n^{\alpha,\rho}(t)$
