{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.220503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1088c6e2d3013f52a7a51ed61b12607d6ccc7d521dd8411ac03178943d5c71c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Prop4:13 of arXiv:2412.06086, 'Zeros of conditional Gaussian analytic functions, random sub-unitary matrices and q-series'] Consider the rescaled point process $\mathcal{V}_a$ defined by the transformation
