{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.006014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e144baa3eace6b063db3af5eefb712a48e514e547c4854837e8e9706d804ae74","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma exx of arXiv:2412.04013, 'Rate estimates for total variation distance with applications\thanks{The author gratefully'] Let $X_{1},X_{2}$ be such that, for some $r,C_{r}>0$, 
