{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.873069+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1475bc115a87659f7f1d56d413988d976613f2d91b238415ddaab7c0fcd015e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem sharplem of arXiv:2411.00629, '\Large Transformation of Stochastic Recursions and Critical Phenomena in the Analysis of t'] Assume $\alpha >1$ in the $\alpha$-Riccati equation. Suppose that $v(t)$, $t>0$ solves
