{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:48:17.122906+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1914a85a6ac33b158ed3230da6728d14c5e2872c8c762d16deaf828dbf69c46","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2605.27713, 'Lower path regularity in all dimensions'] Suppose that $X=(X_t)_{t\in[0,T]}$ satisfies Assumption \ref{a1} and that
