{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.106434+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1938b756c6ef761417a779da046b9fb078bcea235876469773aad672e55ac6c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma martingale of arXiv:2505.04942, '\textbf{Randomized Routing to Remote Queues}'] Assume the conditions of Theorem~(theorem:load-balancing of the paper) hold. Then with probability 1,
