{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:17.370747+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1a7505dc44a1ca2c366f626f67442b0ef4a7606e012008fe74816f0a84b382a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Coro 7 of arXiv:2606.03661, '2606.03661'] The function $\Psi_\alpha^\nu(-\kappa t) =  
