{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.964648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e22449f570179fd85005c96fdc2d6dc90fc8c140f0f76dd28b382e3a0db29260","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {Herbst Argument (Proposition 2.14, \cite{massart2003})}


