{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.091309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e233769adff15c08665f4038057d500fd08a1ebda1bea1a98c03735f0d9fcdbd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2608.19976, 'Random valuations'] A non-negative ID valuation $\Phi$ with vanishing deterministic part
