{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.706473+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e248b99fc96ffc17057fd2cafe956023c9a170716f640621a7e3128399e89fb3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lA4cor of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $q\in(0,p)$
