{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:49.831648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e25d462bd2fd4fdddd2ea61388272bf8830921c0a43ebb269805d7a8f84f0d8a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 1 of arXiv:2506.12145, 'Functional central limit theorem for dependent models with finite memory'] We have the distributional convergence in $D([0,\infty[)$ the Skorokhod space of right-continuous functions with left-hand limits, as $n \to \infty$,
\begin{equation}

