\langle u(t,o)^{p}\rangle=\exp\Big(\frac{1}{2}\sigma^{2}p^{2}t^{2}-d\sqrt{-\frac{Q''(0)}{2}}p^{3/2}t^{3/2}(1+o(1))\Big)\ \ \ \text{as }t\rightarrow\infty.
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:07:17.285002+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e26304ccd23fbe2c999d57448ea41667a9f22446c013d502a88900f55cb4c801","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemme continuityphi of arXiv:2603.21634, 'Individual-based stochastic model with unbounded growth, birth and death rates: a tightnes'] Let $t \in [0,T]$, $\varphi \in \mathcal{C}_{\varpi+\omega}([0,T] \times \mathbb{R}^{*}_{+})$ and $\phi$ continuous on $[0,R_{\max}]$, then
