{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:49:24.956908+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e26683022f7a2b59b70752a6e0c6fc98cdcef986b505022b562e08ac7b6005a7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:discrete_coercivity of arXiv:2609.03164, 'Energy Decay Induced by Localized Coercivity in the 3D Navier--Stokes Equations'] There exists a constant $\alpha_{\omega,N}\ge 0$ such that
