{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.961597+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e26b9908a18756de306b4463c3c0649ea0db38c1f77a4bae376128e1f583d639","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 (Second-chaos representation) of arXiv:2604.00642, 'Quantitative central limit theorem for an integrated periodogram via the fourth moment the'] There exists $k_n\in\Hh^{\odot 2}$ such that
