{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.971220+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2830b68ebe566d6948af61841ddc6bc210eb97cccdcc1c0d7b6ceea4ec1b138","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2607.22438, 'A deterministic scalar reduction for the phase transition in two interacting urns'] For \(u_{\alpha,p}\) defined by \eqref{eq:u-alpha-p}, one has
