{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:45:27.888850+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2be556916d58d42c284caeaaddf08544fa583e4cfce88786852dcc65f7bd8bb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma future of arXiv:2607.02742, 'Gaussian fluctuations for the parabolic Anderson model with L\'evy white noise'] \textup{(Future convolution bound.)}
