{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.727447+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2c1d06729774bf39c36f7b7e717dd025879ce1e96c9f7f089b3becb4248b7f4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2511.14379, 'Stability of storage processes with general release rates'] Let $\Delta,T>0$, and  let $f:[0,T)\to[0,\infty)$ satisfy the following  
 	conditions:
