{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.397395+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2d36a0b0a8b0c6e91d868840a2cfa02abbe4466e20e7dcdd85759069be852d3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 47 ({\cite[Theorem~6.4) of arXiv:2609.04139, 'The conformally invariant metric on CLE$_4$ II:\\ existence of geodesics'] {zhan2019two}}]

