{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:29:14.972444+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e304525169d2cb7bf57cf3143d29330d808dec5494c13cdf2a855e7bfa0dfcb8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2606.15203, 'The existence of invariant sublinear expectations for $G\text{-}$SDEs'] ([pengbook])
