{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.751299+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e319972d91fcfc80dc27ab90ce925f0d116035a178cef2c0e8cbf73d2f484134","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2511.02725, 'Mixing of general biased adjacent transposition chains'] In the same setting as Lemma~\ref{lem:spatial-mixing}, with possibly a different choice of $C'(\eps) = e^{O(1/\eps)}$, one has for $r\ge C'(\eps)\ell_{\max}$ that 
    \begin{align*}
