{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.725111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e32cba94ca8ae44509a8f4f54823573ce9f2dc1297f1a35d734141f72d5cc289","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop: existence riccati of arXiv:2411.04238, 'Holomorphic jump-diffusions'] Fix $\mathbf{u}\in \mathcal S^*$ and $\mathbf{v}$ such that $\exp(h_\mathbf{u})=h_\mathbf{v}$. Let $(\mathbf{c}(t))_{t\in [0,T]}$ be a solution of (equation eq:ODE sequence space holomorphic of the paper) for the initial condition $\mathbf{c}(0)=\mathbf{v}$. Assume that ${\bf c}(t)_{0}\neq0$ 
