{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.705968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e32dc27954059f798f0de3fceb9f42ea1ccbc9bc6817eb72b7fd695c89be225a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 (Kernel of the transformed fractional flux operator) of arXiv:2608.29726, '\LARGE A Priori Estimates for Singular Fractional Stochastic Burgers Equations'] Let \(1<\gamma<2\), \(0<\beta<1\), and let
