{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.663871+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e33b08102dc1f17810124c53ead3a56c7b9842897904a410564f992408beb297","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm macro-cross of arXiv:2609.00110, 'Phase Transition and Fluctuation Results for First-Passage Percolation on Spread-Out Cycle'] Assume Assumption~(ass:weight of the paper), fix $\mathsf{u}\in(0,1/2)$, and let $T_n=T_n^{(\ell)}(0,\mathsf{u}_n)$.
\begin{enumeratea}
 \item 
