\end{align}
$u_{n,k}^{(i)}$ is the unique solution to \eqref{Def:Unki} with $g=\scal{[\mathcal{V}_nC_n]^{(i)}}{\Phi^{(i)}_k}_{H_n}$ and ${\mathfrak{c}}$ is a constant given by Theorem \ref{Thm: soluzione-kolmogorov}, for every $k\in\{1,\ldots,n\}$ and $i\in\{-,+\}$.","status":"unverified"}

