{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:50:30.561272+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e37b83cbf6c6ad327a54073cdd73dd7ab8d1768107e4c26c0e8de66f4382d8f2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 4 of arXiv:2605.30560, 'Projected McKean--Vlasov Dynamics for Entropic Weak Optimal Transport'] Suppose $\mathcal{Y}$ is a Polish space. For $\rho,\sigma\in\mathcal{P}(\mathcal{Y})$, the \emph{relative entropy} is defined as 
