{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:15.197618+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e37d1bcf82f3987cdba289b9e77b36ce7ec776c44ee59e66c5173013298868f4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2607.11773, '2607.11773'] Suppose that {\bf(H1)}-{\bf(H4)}, \eqref{thetaassum2}, \eqref{dissip1} and \eqref{dissip2} hold.
