{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:09.330873+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e3af6c72a69f9b64b93b394730875f3a753c3e8b124958ea489f4cc43a228d2b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2411.06827, 'The Exponential Lie Series and a Chen--Strichartz Formula for L{\'e}vy Processes'] The basis change formula expressing the elements of ${\mathbb A}^\ast$ in terms of the elements of $({\mathbb A}^0)^\ast$ in ${\mathbb R} {\langle}{\mathbb A}{\rangle}$ is obtained as
