    |(|b_v - b_w| - |\phi(v-w)|)| \leq K \end{equation} 
    for every $ v, w \in \mathbb{Z}^d$. Then, there exists $ \epsilon_{i} \in \{ -1, 1\}$ such that the homomorphism 
