{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.162384+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e41d1df1bb3da95aaff0e8bc15adbeead6b5a98a4dd955e744ea303efa011de2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_SmoothingOperators_1D of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] On $L^2((0,\infty),r {\rm d} r;\mathbb{C})$ define
  \begin{equation*}
