{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:37:08.313685+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e470527c8759a2300b9a21f4434bd6f564165f903f992b494f28deff5551a6ed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorema WPFLS of arXiv:2608.30777, 'Inhomogeneous nonlinear Schr\"odinger equation \\ in Fourier-Lebesgue and modulation space'] \
