{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.968527+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e470feaacc6df00543eb857dbd0da71391b7a2c615e8d5300b2dd956dddfb62b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 7 of arXiv:2606.13459, 'Symmetric Cooperative Motion in Higher Dimensions'] Fix $\La > 0$. Suppose $N$ is sufficiently large such that
