{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:35:59.919489+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e47475aabce749a7d3fd5c5c6f3818db6f962f75a123f3128ca148768f5ddc4e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 6 of arXiv:2608.26084, 'Localic Esakia Duality\\via Conic Frames'] We say a partially ordered space~$(X,\leq)$ is:
