{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.594238+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e494f1354bf768a28f8de7b5c98f8719b5984171e1c9a95e3460952382079b8f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary Eq:4.12 of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] The sequence $\{M_k\}_{k=0}^{ n+1}$ defined by $M_0:=\phi_0$ and by
