{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:24:20.980317+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e4d30c5b54bd08f7d4ff8939e18a667ce7035e3b3eb52a690bbcf679f0e5dbba","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:chemical_easy of arXiv:2508.18809, '{\bf Critical long-range percolation III: The upper critical dimension}'] Let $G=(V,E,J)$ be a transitive weighted graph. The following inequalities hold for every $0\leq \beta<\beta_c$.
