{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:44.359219+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e5177094e78e9757ac5ace1ef28571a81baa3fe7d12f1ad31f6bb10786b8b3af","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 of arXiv:2609.03112, '2609.03112'] For fixed $K$, the energy after subtracting $K^2/6$ is
