{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.832937+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e52d64f41798624e9ecd0da9fb7979da4af45697ea244c04ae76d6862cb52b53","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Determinantal cofactor comparison) of arXiv:2607.20329, '2607.20329'] For each $\F\in\{\R,\C\}$ and every $n\ge1$,
