{Then there exist some constants $C>0$, $\varepsilon \in (0,\kappa_{\infty}^{-1}-1)$ and $\delta_0>0$ such that, for all $M \in \bN^*$, $N \in \bN^*$, $n \in \bN$ and $\delta \leqslant \delta_0$,
