{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.728642+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e573bde0ffc2d197d2d66efa0739f0384892022c588f235f83e803aeb2b8eb3d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def-sol-infinity of arXiv:2411.04500, '\LARGE Probabilistic Approaches to The Energy Equality in Forced Surface Quasi-Geostrophic'] Let $g\in L_{loc}^2([0,\infty);H)$. We say that $\theta$ is a weak solution of  
