{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.075728+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e57e6336cba7a1384bcd547c35a88c86183b1f7f7884c42824ea75091b59489f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Finite-horizon error decomposition) of arXiv:2608.19762, '2608.19762'] Let
