{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.752638+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e603bb7180827f56c04433a213979b2d77741ba76ac292e30950189b48369540","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 8 (Pruning procedure) of arXiv:2604.11682, 'Semilocalization for inhomogeneous random graphs'] The graph $G^\pp$ is defined by the following procedure.
