        \item [d)] $\displaystyle\sum_{k=1}^{\infty}\frac{1}{r_k^4}\dE[ (\Delta Z_k)^4 \mathbb{I}_{\{|\Delta Z_k|  \le \delta r_k\}}] < +\infty$ for some $\delta > 0$. 
