        \mathbb{E}\big[\prod_{j=1}^s \mathrm{Tr} (\widetilde{T}_{n_j}(X)+b'_{n_j}\mathbf{I})\big]=\sum_{\Gamma\in \mathscr{D}_{s;\beta}} \mathfrak{F}_{\Gamma}(\{n_j\}).
