{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.468428+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e68a99e1eaca1cc2dd793d5886d82bcd7a0812d256b333c4a1ae34455bef69dc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:ergolgamma of arXiv:2505.12187, 'Speeding up quantum Markov processes through lifting'] Let $\mathcal{L}_\gamma$ be a QMS generator of the form (equation eq:decom of the paper) satisfying Conditions~(asspA of the paper) and~(assump:PHP of the paper). Then the semigroup $\exp(t \mathcal{L}_\gamma)$ is ergodic: 
