{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:24:20.637789+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e68b8b1d46ef24fc63170342bff3ff5907d384cd546dfbcac166797b75d6f423","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] For an element $a\in A$, the following are equivalent:
