    Moreover, in the second case, if $(s_k)_k$ is strictly increasing (resp.~decreasing), then $\fs(\mathcal{G}) \in \{s^\natural, s^\flat\}$ (resp.~$\fs(\mathcal{G}) \in \{s^\natural, s^\sharp\}$).","status":"unverified"}

