{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.898421+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e71446c3550eb5ad91664bab309d05323652d28662c8c4eda9268df75e82157d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:chenlam19 of arXiv:2510.26960, 'Free energy fluctuations in SK and related spin glass models: \\ A literature survey'] The following statements hold:
    \begin{enumerate}
