{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.948775+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e71f98fb154da896c89f5d1a404474daee5f87b837461e495dea41666e7b52e3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 (Slightly supercritical maximal hitting bound) of arXiv:2607.13183, '2607.13183'] Let $H_{\rm ER}$ be the giant component of $G(n,(1+\eps)/n)$, where
