{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.683428+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e72a7ee318ff2e16a1daacb1c26d5ecfeec7c81baaf8e430761986f1574ac734","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 17 of arXiv:2609.03777, '2609.03777'] For $\tau\in C$ and $N\in\ZZ_{>0}$, we have
