{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.316988+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7913424f6223d771feb2fe1a8921c3e05682cf94e67e8ecb71780a5ea788b5f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 17 (Endpoint branch is dominated for $a \ge 1$) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] Let $a \ge 1$ and $p \in (0, \bar p(a))$. Then
