{u }\left( t ,x \right) \in C\left( {\left[ {0,\mathfrak{t}} \right];{C^\gamma }\left( {{\mathbb{T}^2};{\mathbb{R}^2}} \right)} \right) ,\ \ \mbox{with temporal support} \ {\mathrm{supp}_\mathrm{t}} \ u \subset \left[ {0,\mathfrak{t}} \right]   ,\  \mathbb{P}\mbox{-a.s.} ,
