{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.329479+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7c20e4b2a54389981ca79a74edb8c4b4da339d77fd1329e09188ec14a1e73ec","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor diag-preserve of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] The functor $\textup{diag}\colon{\mathfrak d\kern-.25pt}{\mathfrak S\kern-.5pt\mathfrak p}_\textup{$G$-lvl}\to{\mathfrak S\kern-.5pt\mathfrak p}_\textup{$G$-gl}$ inverts $G$-global weak equivalences.
