{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:01:25.653904+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e7f0d6e6918df5c0e455768127ed96cf5da8be5fb13c0e1d90223006c736e6f0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm:cluster-expansion of arXiv:2605.16162, 'Deconfinement For $\mathrm{SO}(3)$ Lattice Yang--Mills at Strong Coupling'] There is a $\beta^* = \beta^*(d)>0$ such that 
    \begin{enumerate}
