{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.896514+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e803eb1af82ce0b76c188f375e926a3645c6b9cb7bd0bf395b8611a7f4ea69c4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 25 of arXiv:2606.19115, 'Finite free perpetuities'] Let $p\in\pols_n(\C)$ and $U$ be any $U$-transform of $p$. Let $d\in\{0,\dots,n-1\}$. Then 
