{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.611877+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e836a06817f7271199bf50d3b82a1c8dba7a00e55823bfcd51fcb0a2b1504150","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 32 of arXiv:2607.08536, 'Soft edge limit of the Laguerre beta-ensemble at the lower edge'] On the event $\Omega_{n,T,\sfc}$, when $n$ is large enough, we have 
