{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.541718+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e8ac8503780b7e0dd239a687a4a69041aa1e6143d7091c586d8b792703e0624b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 95 of arXiv:2609.01389, 'K-stability and birational rigidity of Fano 3-fold weighted complete intersections'] We have $H|_S = \Gamma + \Delta$, where $\Gamma$ and $\Delta$ are irreducible and reduced curves satisfying the following properties.
