{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.291685+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9320689f56577bb1622f87a5da3d44231eb934a0293f2fbd747deb28af74abd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1l of arXiv:2411.05204, '\Large\bf Sample Path Properties of the Fractional Wiener--Weierstrass Bridge'] Fix $N\in\mathbb N$ and suppose that $K\in(2H-1,H)$. Define
