{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.296237+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e93e873c8982b2a0147b4683d0a8d24846550d9cb5360350663d8823592a4efc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Problem probICPDou of arXiv:2411.05534, 'Inverse problems for stochastic partial differential equations'] Find the unknown solution
