{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:33:21.471831+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9658ed807079e310011f1595fd4e187371c250300c93f7064d8cf7fb1b61263","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: Exp1overDeg of arXiv:2606.19583, 'Power-law hypothesis and (un)fairness of PageRank on undirected multi-type PAMs'] Let $\psi_1(z):=\frac{d^2}{dz^2}\log(\Gamma(z))$ be the trigamma function. Then 
