{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:13:21.343303+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9b583ae24301b78b417a796be76c1d620c2191b7ca969dce2b6f83ba9596bb7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2609.01540, '2609.01540'] Let \(g_j\) be smooth metrics on \(B_2\subset\mathbb R^n\) such that
