{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:28.178595+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9b702a627c2fcbd2bd1d7ef50214e1c9ccfbc75e897225546546379a41c7c1e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop spec-frag-transient of arXiv:2511.10223, 'Stochastic Reaction Networks Within Interacting Compartments with Content-Dependent Fragme'] Let $N$ be the coarse-grained model associated with (equation eq:specific-content-dependent-fragmentation of the paper)
