{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.514543+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e9f2a8ab463889cfce5fab8d9fc87b6347d87eb14ea1283f7b3e41f04d9ffc21","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2608.28528, 'Strong solutions of SDEs with critical discontinuities in diffusion coefficients'] Let $X_t^x=X_{0,t}^x$ be the strong solution to \eqref{sde0}. Then, 
