{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:49:21.137815+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea0087594124fc8920e6a5b37ad1a295d9594cc8ededf02362cda0fe84a0f058","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 39 of arXiv:2608.26698, 'Mapping class groups of simply connected closed spin 5-manifolds with no 2- and 3-torsion '] Let $M$ be a simply connected closed spin 5-manifold, and let $S : S^4 \times D^1 \hookrightarrow M$ be an embedding.
