{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.500842+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea23abfb526d3866e9da7e797bbbd396adef93530856cfd5204bcbbaed33e712","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem : Intro/main_thm/LemmeCool of arXiv:2412.03320, 'Large deviation principle at speed $n$ for the random metric in first-passage percolation'] Under Assumption~(equation ass : Intro/main_thm/ShapeThmStrong of the paper), there exists a constant $\kappa<\infty$ such that 
