{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:15:09.114661+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea2f9898d4d0713b17871753a37a0ce061c6a57bb44c8bba049044e2a0984046","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary Upper bound for cumulants of GUE for epsilon cumulants of arXiv:2411.11341, 'Ultra high order cumulants and quantitative CLT for polynomials in Random Matrices'] Let $\mathcal{X}\sim GUE$. For any $r\geq 1$, $m$ even and $\epsilon\in \{1,{\top}\}^m$,
