{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.757551+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea301f07bcc4593605b675a4fd7a950f2c9f3f7cc174871f89094649e5a06725","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:borel-trace-form-event of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] There exists a Borel set $\Omega_{\rm tr}\subseteq\Omega_{\rm GMC}$ with
