{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.036181+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea729f387f09452cd0ca624e6e6450ab6209a39997cefac300206d56986a4836","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2608.26565, 'A Horizon-Free Extrinsic Penrose Inequality'] The first variation is
