{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.597347+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea87e260f9aaee6cb2978091fecc97b7499932f932353c88606ea527d5229717","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 14 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] Under $\Pp_{\mathfrak a}$, the sequence

