{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:45:27.886552+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eacfddec5ba0533618d22be18c277dc8267ca0a6415443a88a8e703171aa8e14","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:subsolution dual of arXiv:2607.02367, 'Flux solutions for stochastic chemical systems with sources and sinks'] Let $ \varepsilon >0 $ and $c_0 \geq 1 $. 
