{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:21:45.336243+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eae2e9211d6f39e724bc29c475afbd79be0da75bb53f82d0a707493256c1fe6c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2607.27150, 'Modelling Anomalous Diffusion: The Role of CTRWs and Non-Local Dynamics'] The process $(Z_u^+)_{u\ge0}$ is a Feller process on $E\times[0,\infty)$ with the generator $\mathfrak{A}^+$ such that
