The existence of \(\bar C\) and the exponential return bound~(equation eq:return of the paper) is a standard consequence of geometric ergodicity; see, for example, Theorem~15.0.1 of [Meyn12_book] and Theorem~15.1.5 of [douc2018markov]. The minorization condition~(equation eq:M of the paper) is the standard small-set minorization; see Proposition~5.2.4 of [Meyn12_book]. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

