{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.894143+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb496f690e3f9c59352ad3849089a8ec41ec0ed5979052ea26c71bafa3b4f71a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 14 of arXiv:2606.18877, 'Ergodic Properties of Non-Linear Density-Dependent Perturbations of the Ornstein--Uhlenbec'] Let \(Y_t\) be the Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process defined in~\eqref{OU_a0}, and let \(c>0\) be a fixed constant. Then for any \(0<T<\infty\) fixed it holds that
