{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:14.297753+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb7e7cbae0c41e64f740bb7bfb874bef344695eedb2bced15d6c2ba8c3812478","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LEM:hyp of arXiv:2412.09790, 'Critical threshold for weakly interacting log-correlated focusing Gibbs measures'] Let $\left\{g_n\right\}_{n\in \mathbb{Z}^d}$ be a sequence of independent standard real-valued Gaussian
