{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.511180+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb85357c821ce48d6e63bc96f943b8a1c6b06f7738413965c68927ae8a1ba328","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 (Spectral zero pattern) of arXiv:2609.02590, 'Directional Optimal Sub-Gamma Scales for Infinitely Divisible Laws'] The directional scales satisfy
