    \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.239798+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eba3d2c84176e57ac61a83449d11254d42173d530ef2e150c3c89d78cc6ae9fb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 62 of arXiv:2609.00567, 'Hodge--Tate splitting and Akizuki--Nakano vanishing in positive characteristic'] There is a natural transformation
