\end{equation} (Stated as a conjecture by the paper; open unless the paper says otherwise.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.348331+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ebf2cc602726a5d19942c9b8da39c65c4750a77ec8360d9a06503046ab494d4f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 of arXiv:2506.15159, 'Conditional central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] In any compact subset $B$ of the subcritical region \cref{Sub},

