{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.763910+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec1c6ad36fa9f5335ed879a7fc3095bc6793190571e5b8fc86571fc45150d3d2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 (Milstein scheme) of arXiv:2512.04646, '\textbf{Canonical Rough Path over Tempered Fractional Brownian Motion: Existence, Construc'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~\ref{thm:rde}, let
