{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:35:19.873647+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec1f46a312e91e2f4e3698d159dfa9d7231ab184fb762e989fabdcaebd40cb81","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:exact-recursion of arXiv:2608.26765, 'Beyond Client Averaging: A Client-Independent Second-Order Stationary-Bias Component in St'] For one communication round,
\begin{align}
  \theta_{c,h+1}
