{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:07:17.277524+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec220922976976e2f09d312108921ca52568691aedfe4d5f5ae7eabc0c3c2bbc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:short-exp-weighted of arXiv:2603.14906, 'Four Levels of Thermodynamic Convergence of Singularly Perturbed Markov Semigroups'] Let $\kappa\ge0$. For each $\varepsilon>0$ let $h^\varepsilon\in C^{1}((0,\infty))$ and assume that
\begin{enumerate}
