{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.350963+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec544eaee02c256c02fd70c6d498ad8e438bc3e38b3c8327612bdb272454aa16","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Theorem 1_2 of arXiv:2607.19651, 'Metastability and phase transition in a social network model with multiple opinions'] For any $\beta>0$, $0<\alpha<\frac{1}{M-1}$, and starting matrix $u\in\mathcal{S}^{\alpha}$:
