{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.583055+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec9767e28e69255491dbfb84e6a4fdb5fee8b93e3ad815beb8a1d238436d67f8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 (Smoothness of $\cF$) of arXiv:2609.01333, '2609.01333'] The functional $\cF:\cO\cap X\to Y$ is $C^\infty$. Moreover, the Fr\'echet derivative $D\cF(\varphi): X\to Y$ is given by
