{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.975744+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec9f30da070f3d729d52ce80122759752c693c4284d5322775376c03241c6af0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma def:local of arXiv:2411.07157, 'Rough differential equations in the flow approach'] We define for any smooth function $f:\R^{2}\rightarrow\R$ 
