{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.430565+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eccf74b21418b08b93361961dcc440003e31cc98db24216c8c7f55667d94de87","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Pk-rank-common-noise of arXiv:2604.22453, 'Adapted Wasserstein Barycenters of Gaussian Processes'] Let \(\mathbf P\in\mathscr{P}_+(K,d)\).  Then \(\rank(\mathbf P)=d\) if and only if there exist orthogonal matrices \(\mathbf Q^1,\ldots,\mathbf Q^K\in\mathscr O(d)\) such that
