			\left|\hat{\mathbb{E}}\left[\phi\left(\frac{1}{n}\sum_{k=1}^nX_k\right)\right]-\max_{x\in \Gamma_{n_{\gamma}}}\phi(x) \right|\leq C\big(1+\hat{\mathbb{E}}[|X_1|^2]\big)l_{\phi}\bigl(n^{-(1-\gamma)/2}+n^{-\gamma(1-\gamma')}\bigr),
