        \mathbb{P}_{z}\Big(\tau_{\widetildeT_{i',j'}} = \tau_ {T_{i,J}},\tau_{\widetildeT_{i',j'}}<\tau_{\partial \widetilde{B}(z)}\Big)<c_2\Big(\log(m/|J|)+1\Big)|J|/n, \quad \text{for all } z\in\partialV_{i,J},
