    \textnormal{(ii) (Lower bound)} There exist positive constants $c_3(u_1)\le \min\{1,1/(2c_2)\}$, $c_4(u_1)$ and $n_3(u_1)$ such that for all $n>n_3$, $m=[c_3n]$, $1\le i, i'\le n$, $1\le j'\le m$, and $z\in\partial S_i$,
