{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.701582+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ed75956a0813244f28fada9e00750d18c5704a4b92c1f639e151846ac6b4bdcf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 76 of arXiv:2608.09700, 'A general paracontrolled ansatz for singular SPDEs'] For any tree $\tau\in \dot\mcT\sqcup \dot\mcT^{+}$ and $n\geq0$
