{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.359636+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eda883762fc06598013b4b07c0eccfbc01cacfca259e3d4cf6a93c13cf133cf8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] The following estimates hold.
