-\Delta y_k=\big[\mathbf{1}_{\{k<N-1\}}(A_1^\tau y_{k+1}+A_2^\tau \mathbb{E}y_{k+1}+A_3^\tau \mathbb{E}y_{k+\tau+1})+Q_1x_{k+1}+Q_2\mathbb{E}x_{k+1}\\
