for all $\phi \in C_b^1(H)$, provided such a $\beta_h \in L^1(\mu_t)$ exists.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:25:41.601168+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ee07899cad352656654bb30b2c79e45e8dee321e5193e05cf87c3bfa9d645389","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2608.12947, 'Branch-stationary max-stable fields on rooted trees'] For the process in (equation 23 of the paper), the following
