{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.508720+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ee1d6abf46bebefb636f0a0329256a5e034e78b8e2cdf87286e59ab21d62c6b2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2609.02581, '\bfseries Interior Curvature Estimates for the Graphical Scalar Curvature Equation in All '] Let $n\geq3$. Suppose that $u$ satisfies \eqref{eq:intro-equation} and $H\geq2$. Then at a point where $h_i^j$ is diagonal, the following Jacobi-type inequality holds:
