{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.220792+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ee37d97f9d27ef63bd093d3e8f04c50a92f24b31fd49169936465d62b46ea365","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 6 ({${p}$-ary entropy function and the Johnson radius}) of arXiv:2609.00483, 'On Embedding Hamming Spheres with Applications to Positive Curvature'] Let $\delta \in [0,\frac{p-1}{p}]$.
