		\frac{\partial }{\partial t}p(x,t)=&-\frac{\partial }{\partial x}\big\{\big(f(x)+\frac{1}{2}g(x)g'(x)+Ht^{2H-1}h(x)h'(x)\big)p(x,t)\big\}\cr
