{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.578664+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eecd59698c4e3fa3bcc3af6fbc75991056b22e0f6a8478c6c5daff10727c330f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $k\in \Nbb$, $f\in \Sob^k(\Rbb^n,\gamma_n)$ and $q\in [1,2)$,
