{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.567570+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eed07a3276dbeedae2c34eae8dab4019e42941fb746750aac2b3023773922611","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:irreg3 of arXiv:2412.03366, 'Regularity of Weighted Tensorized Fractional Brownian Fields and associated function space'] One has 
