{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:21.318613+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eed375dd98fa4e35d004e5bdb963500e1c7cc6bbd5b06d72cf2ffd6a47a33458","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Exact occupancy mixture) of arXiv:2604.09933, 'Explicit cutoff profiles for colored top-\texorpdfstring{$m$}{m}-to-random shuffles'] For every \(k\ge0\),
