{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:40:26.999940+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef2a968e35d3acd57bc80d0915e3f2d40f9ada6f56f89c26b21ff82e9753984f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2604.17253, 'Large Deviations for the Nonlinear Schrödinger Equation with Randomized Quasi-Periodic Ini'] The {\em second counting function} $\ell$ is defined by
