{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:44.949695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef2efe5e9880449fe9cd3300ca5af617df122dfd158ccf5b609fc30adf36eaa2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 (Properties of $v_\beta$) of arXiv:2606.24887, '2606.24887'] Let $\beta = (\beta_1, \beta_2) \in [0,\infty)^2$ and let $v_\beta$ be defined as in \eqref{eq:def_v_beta}. 
