{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:17.370670+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef4b7efdc14cc780b496ac6fd7517c6eb92c9c01f995646bb12959a5e086591e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6 of arXiv:2606.03661, '2606.03661'] Let $\sideset{_1^{}}{_1^{}}{\operatorname{\mathfrak{F}}}(a;b;z)$ be the
