{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.837527+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_efd28bd3c0006d776f8e9667a9ec27a1ee8a9851bfbb5748a9f49e6390ce1b58","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn of arXiv:2607.25567, 'Random Trees in Hyperbolic FPP'] The {\bf hyperbolic cross-ratio} of an ordered tuple of four points $x, y, z, w$ in $\Gamma$ is defined to be $$[x:y:z:w] := \frac{1}{2}
