{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.445454+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f00df960248d576cf71036c46cf0ec319a9ca9b1c81b007975e972797d6dd831","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: QV of M_n for general time scale of arXiv:2505.05921, 'Limit Theorems for step reinforced random walks\\ with regularly varying memory'] {}
