{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:51:11.970415+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f021a99c2da58c9c335ea7a701342125b9e47d14a1fed5beceb78cbf7f49ca04","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 19 (First-row ancestry bound) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] For every \(\lambda\vdash n\),
