{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.591269+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f022c061d5e3da0aea14364e12b7b0138aab91f01645ed549ff9bb27881cf523","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2602.19773, 'Regularization of a stationary point process by a stationary increments perturbation'] Let $B$ be a $\mathbb{R}^{d}$-valued Gaussian process with stationary increments. Then,
