{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:41:33.825513+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f02b206e9241c3d19ed5732f7055223b395646099ea41b49b124fb37c34181c5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 6 of arXiv:2604.10266, 'A singular SDE driven by additive fractional Brownian motion with Hurst parameter $H<\frac'] There exists a nonnegative process $L^H=\{L_t^H, t\geq 0\}$ such that
