\le
\sum_{i=1}^m \Pb \big[\{X_{i-1}\in B\}\Delta\{X_i\in B\}\big].
\end{align*}
Equivalently,
\begin{align*}
\mathcal E_B[X_0,X_m]
\le
\sum_{i=1}^m \mathcal E_B[X_{i-1},X_i].
\end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

