{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.500319+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f04c0bc8f269ebc3e5703e4fb7b116be565b311ed3f23e756c06560c6aff5a55","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 of arXiv:2605.10150, 'Rough path theory and an introduction to rough partial differential equations'] For a rough path $\bfx = (X,\bbx) \in \scrc^{\alpha}([0,T],V)$ the following statements are equivalent:
