{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.587226+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f05f994427b4db35a4f62de5d135527f55bd66797003a8eb720111b1b7319b7b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm def:interac of arXiv:2509.08659, 'Gap metrics for stationary point processes and quantitative convexity of the free energy'] {georgii2}}]
   For every $\mathsf{P}\in \mathcal P_{s,1}(\Gamma)$, the limit
