{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:26:47.157313+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f09e09c8c5454bbb4585e04500c6c6eb55eeb33111835f9b1142c2b9f4006ac3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 13 of arXiv:2608.29406, 'Partially Totally Real Submanifolds of Sasakian Manifolds'] For $X,Y\in\Gamma(\Dtilde)$ define
