{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:52.207673+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f0f609e6d26aec971ed1718c57fcbb6dcc2dbf534048d5d39f04a2d7448bc6d0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 (Asymptotics for $\alpha \to \alpha_0$, $\alpha_0 \in \inter{\mathcal M}$) of arXiv:2512.09136, 'On the Green's functions and Martin boundary structure of a planar diffusion in a disconti'] Let $z_0 \in \R^2$. Then, if $\alpha_0 \in \inter{\mathcal{M}}\cap (0, \pi)$, we have
\begin{equation}
