{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.331273+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1116c2b399b657974b60fdac40122e6a6782ff0d06587aaaafe32654be1847b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma prop:heat_content_upperbound of arXiv:2609.04045, 'Heat content and spectrum for subordinated sub-Laplacians'] For any Caccioppoli set $\Omega$ and $t>0$, we have 
