{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:59.494272+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f11280deb850055c695bd5c7467705d5df0a3118377d8d4fdefdaa7ae8bc325c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2605.09459, 'Multipoint connectivity in the branching interlacement process'] Let $x_1,\dots,x_k \in \mathbb{Z}^d$. Let $X$ be a random walk indexed by an infinite critical tree $\mathcal{T}$. Then under $\P_{x_1}$,
  \begin{equation}
    \{x_1,\dots,x_k \in \mathrm{Range}(X)\} = \bigcup_{m=0}^{k-1}\bigcup_{z_1,\dots,z_m \in \mathbb{Z}^d} \bigcup_{T \in \mathbb{T}_{k+m}^k(\overline{x}_k,\overline{z}_m)} \left\{\begin{array}{c} X \text{ connects } x_1,\dots,x_k, z_1,\dots,z_m\\ \text{ following } T\end{array}\right\}.
  \end{equation}
  Consequently, if $\mu$ has a finite moment of order $2k-1$,
  \begin{equation}
    \P_{x_1}\big(x_1,\dots,x_k \in \mathrm{Range}(X)\big) \lesssim \sum_{m=0}^{k-1}\sum_{z_1,\dots,z_m \in \mathbb{Z}^d} \sum_{T \in \mathbb{T}_{k+m}^k(\overline{x}_k,\overline{z}_m)} \prod_{\{u,v\}\in E(T)}\frac{1}{1+\|u-v\|^{d-2}}.
  \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.121571+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f116a8e2bb9be929eafcdbcd4b19c70d2502be3be92169596f78a83e102e6316","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Ball-influence-on-crossing of arXiv:2606.13147, 'Scaling limits of the single-curve interface and outermost loops in the planar random fiel'] Let $\mathcal V_1$ denote the event that there exists a plus crossing connecting  $\partial\Lambda_{M/2}$ and $\partial\Lambda_{M/4+1}$, and
