{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:06.328747+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f11c24997a2e2749fc44d8fd8b9535c8de8baee35033050836b5061783d7599f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 4 of arXiv:2607.06428, 'Impact of spinning on the early-warning signs in non-Markovian stochastic systems'] {\em((Power) spectral density)}
