{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.591274+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f12b9fcb72fef8d9d7a7c95da12e265f13ed45fe5d0bdad3af90c3ff26369b9e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:timeChange of arXiv:2412.04973, 'On the Laplace equation with non-local dynamical boundary conditions'] Let $\Lambda>0$, $l \geq 0$, $k <0$ and $\alpha \in (0,1]$. The solution to (equation ELambda of the paper) has the probabilistic representation
\begin{align*}
