{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.359369+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f12fa5c6bd74c79886806ec0645dc1b3ce3ae83831612c84825df195582ad6cd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:some_properties_of_K of arXiv:2412.01645, 'Regularisation by Gaussian rough path lifts of fractional Brownian motions'] The following hold:
