  of \(\setF_p\)-stacks, where \(\pi_S \colon S \to S^{\dR}\) is the natural morphism given in \Cref{DefdeRhamStack} and \(\sigma_{S,r} \colon W_rS_{\setF_p} \to S^{\dR}\) is the morphism obtained by \cite{petrov2025Decomposition}*{Corollary~4.4} (\Cref{ConstPetrov}).","status":"unverified"}

