{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.277694+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1b710311b5445be3f345187f9b3217ebf9136253b3865453fd8251d69be1013","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 7 of arXiv:2606.22526, 'The conditional expectation of the product of the first $n-1$ Hermite polynomials in a mul'] Assuming the sequence of random variables $X_{1},\ldots,X_{n}$ form a Markov
