{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.595492+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1b7e62f5bc1a2869be346c8759792d4cc3a140305fd4ac591ee2ffe17a11279","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th 5.1111 of arXiv:2511.07173, '\bf Mean-field backward stochastic Volterra integral equations: well-posedness and related'] \rm
