{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:25:05.732352+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1d136ccdbd8a92bda0e0f9b2c474709919e7b5dbe57bee99e8bab26d2c74c56","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 (Localized empirical-process bound) of arXiv:2608.22179, '\bf Token-Level Likelihood-Array Regression for Membership Inference and AI-Generated Text'] Let \(Z\) be a centered Hilbert-space feature with covariance operator \(\Gamma_Z\),
