	\end{equation*}
	for all $s \in [a, t]$ and $x, y \in \mathbbm{R}_+$. If $\boldsymbol{\mu} \in \mathcal{S}_{\bar \boldsymbol{y}}[a, b]$ satisfies (equation eq: integrable total variation of the paper), then (equation eq: application of duality method of the paper) holds:
