        \Big\lparen
            \frac{y}{\alpha}\,\frac{\beta+\alpha x+\beta y+\alpha \beta x y}{1+x+y+\beta x y}
            &,\quad& \frac{x}{\beta}\,\frac{\alpha+\alpha x+\beta y+\alpha \beta x y}{1+x+y+\alpha x y}
        &&\Big\rparen,
        \\

        \HIIp(x, y)
        &=
