{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.570724+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f237936127994c79296d5f11195172d46267f23241b88f5d81971d6c46300e0a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2606.14443, 'SEMICLASSICAL LIMIT OF POLYAKOV-LIOUVILLE MEASURE and Q-Curvature Uniformization ON EVEN-D'] Let  $(h_{\ell})_{\ell\in\N}$ be
