        \abs{\left\{\zeta \in B_1(r,\eta) \, \colon \, e_+ \in S(\eta,\zeta)\right\}} \leqslant C_2i \cdot \max \set{1, \brac{\frac{r}{i}}^{(d-1)(m-1)}}
