{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:32:18.840095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f269f7af0adeb1be603741ac568445ac283a4e3e1442defc9c28e85c8a37506e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 6 of arXiv:2609.03831, 'On flows generated by square-integrable vector fields'] Let $\rho \in L^1_\loc(I\times \R^d)$ be a weak solution of \eqref{CE}.
Let $N\subset I$ be given by Proposition~\ref{prop-CE-int} and let $s\in I\setminus N$.
Then for any $t\in \overline{I}$ the distribution
\begin{equation}
