{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:11.711889+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f2aa54f0c3ac86585498cf03aae9928463125e3bef6d1bd2d2cfbc1336b8e81f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem theorem_localized_eigenvector_localization of arXiv:2504.00512, 'Localization-delocalization transition for a random block matrix model at the edge'] Under (main_assm of the paper), given any $k\in[\![{1,DN}]\!]$, suppose there exists a positive constant $\varepsilon_A$ such that
