{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.645638+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f2ce5f45f38d44d3b889983469c38de8c6780a0137fe80a8bdfccc52058a0647","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 (Shifted Wasserstein recursion) of arXiv:2605.24937, '2605.24937'] Assume~\eqref{eq:one-step-w2-framework}. For all $0\le n\le N-2$,
