{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:09:43.677417+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f303ad276d220dd0fc5285d4e20529b9e81f15ae432a53dbe40389e4a157041a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma1 of arXiv:2605.28204, 'Estimates of $mm$-entropy of a stable L\'evy process\footnote{Work supported by grant no. '] For every $n \ge 0$ and every $x\in \mathbb D$ it is true that
