{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.594515+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f343c7e5d9f96545d3246b84ba0d4ed54d5909b85bea03250bd4d3d327b1dd15","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma-1.4 of arXiv:2412.08964, 'Phase transition and critical behavior in hierarchical\\integer-valued Gaussian and Coulom'] Let~$\beta>0$ and  let $v_\star$ be a $1$-periodic continuous function such that  (equation Eq:3.33 of the paper) holds.  Let~$\nu_\star$ be the Borel measure  on~$[0,1)$  defined by
\begin{equation}

