{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.157980+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f350bf1ba78013b29130f52cee7ef3f4fa0e8bf50a85a379778a5bd6a7669bab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 of arXiv:2604.15874, 'On Continuous Data Assimilation for a class of 2D and 3D stochastic non-Newtonian fluids o'] In this lemma, we collect some inequalities that will be used later on:
