{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.015827+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f35288ef21203ef5b08f858a157d5575726eee43b4cbb739f267d3d48d9bc544","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2608.26288, 'Muon with Finite Newton--Schulz: The Smoothing Benefit in Nonsmooth Nonconvex Optimization'] Suppose~\cref{ass:general-spectral-link} holds.
