{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:31.957944+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f360eab4944fcdefd33cec671d6b96345085ddca52d2bce6ce7b4488391775a7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm 7 of arXiv:2512.02286, 'Pfaffian Transition Probability and Correlation Kernel of TASEP in Half-space'] For fixed integers $N\geq M\geq 0$ let $x=(x_1,\dots,x_N)$ and $y=(y_1,\dots,y_M)$ be half-space configurations. The following orthogonality holds:

