		\times \prod_{i=1}^N\left[\frac{1-q w_i^2}{w_i(q+\alpha-1-\alpha w_i)(1-qw_i)} \left(\frac{1-w_i}{1-qw_i}\right)^{x_i-1}\right] \mathcal{F}_y(w_1,\dots,w_N) = \delta_{x,y}.
