{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.968245+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3a78718beb2d17af20f9735153461dc627e85589d89f1dbfbb1ec133f0b2208","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 (Process-level punctured intertwining) of arXiv:2607.13210, 'Punctured Wilson--Evolving Sets and Root Identities for Massive Kirchhoff Forests'] One has the following intertwining:
