{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.491848+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3a8d6cfc5f31320850a5768c07c2d9f2291da092b0940e48e059f872ad754e6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 (Integration, Step 4.a) of arXiv:2605.28677, 'Weak universality for stochastic reaction-diffusion models\\ with long-range correlated no'] Let $[\beta]\geq0$ and assume that \eqref{est_Pi-} holds for $\Pi^-_{x\beta}$. Then

