{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.577184+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3de94476fb3f324a56f07fd0c58880201d81740a6e4e904e6ae4e4469011b35","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 of arXiv:2608.25094, 'Noising-Denoising by Large Temperature Schr\"{o}dinger Bridges'] Under Assumption \ref{assumption}, it holds that 
