for all $r \geq r_0$ and $\alpha \in [\alpha_1-\eta, \alpha_1 + \eta]$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.120244+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4184187672fbbb17d58521f5932fe29c3a6531b3ac1e13e057f2219542a8369","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2604.04848, '\bf Addendum to:\\ Bounds for survival probabilities in \\ supercritical Galton-Watson pro'] For every $r\ge2$ and every $\ze\in(0,1)$, the pgfs $\varphiNB$ and $\varphiFL$ satisfy
