    Let $\pi_Z: X \to Z$ be a nilfactor over $Z^0(X)$ and $p: Z \to Y$ a finite-to-one factor map over $Z^0(X)$ with $\pi_Y = p \circ \pi_Z$. Then there exists an isomorphism
    $$ Z \simeq \bigsqcup_{n, m \geq 0} \Omega_{n, m} \rtimes_{\rho_{n, m}} N / \Gamma_{n, m}$$
