    \end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:12.025679+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f42118052d323c6216e50995544c7b3db420c7cc3da829f816d1f18be92cffc1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo thm:main of arXiv:2512.06984, 'Infinite Dimensional Multifractal Analysis of the Wiener measure'] Let $ \alpha \in (0,1/2)$. Under the $ C^0$-norm, the local order of the Wiener measure $W$ satisfies 
