as $L \to \infty$. Here, $\pi_L$ is the projection map in $H^1(\mathbb{T}_L)$ onto the soliton manifold $\mathcal{M}_L$ 
\begin{align}
\mathcal{M}_L:=\big\{ e^{i \theta} \eta(\cdot-x_0) LQ(L(\cdot-x_0)): \theta \in [0,2\pi], \; x_0 \in \mathbb{T}_L  \big\}, 

