{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.440702+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4613a5a71e4d4eebdef878695d59ff50d4c936a83c9d474afffb7a04f83ed3c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:F_upper_bound of arXiv:2508.17838, '\bf Edge Universality for Inhomogeneous Random Matrices'] With the same notation and assumptions (itm:B1 of the paper)-(itm:B2 of the paper) in Definition (mixingdef of the paper), with $\|A_N\|_{\mathrm{op}}=a$, the following upper bounds hold.
