{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.899124+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4a245deb7a51f5590eceab4c6606af3130132b7b4e8e8f392192c4a690c02fa","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 27 of arXiv:2608.02103, '$p$-Adic Diffusion and Random Walks on $[0,1]$'] Let $\mathfrak{M}_n$ be the Markov 

    process 
