{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.762544+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4d5cff8008d27a8a120f26cebec080e71fb920f94511469db7e44185b025f45","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2512.04544, 'On the diameter of random uniform hypergraphs in dense regime'] Let $t,c,d,n,p$ and  $N$ be as in Assumption \ref{ass main} and $\delta_1$  be as in \Cref{lemma 14}. Let $1 \leq k \leq d -1$ and $ v \in  \Gamma_{k-1} (x) $ be a fixed vertex. 
