{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.238701+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4e8872f77a86ec0050ef3260f8a19414f18c89c879f651c2e60a2b527add7b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop: renormalized cost fcn of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] For every $u \in \mathbb H$, 
