{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.358814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4fdda9d8e4fb0655d4fcaafe1320c05800708a4a5db99dadd068d9116faab01","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:continuity_projection_Sobolev of arXiv:2412.01645, 'Regularisation by Gaussian rough path lifts of fractional Brownian motions'] For $k \in\mathbb{N}, p \geq 2$, there exists a constant $C=C(k,p)$ such that for all $F \in \mathbb{D}^{k,p}(V)$ we have 
