{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.906254+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f4fea2c15bb7ca6bcb11a621fffcd59e33e3836449e273d512ee63cf62c465ac","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:trace-diagonal of arXiv:2608.26707, 'An Exponential Lower Bound for the Permanent\\of Random Bernoulli Matrix'] Conditionally on $\mathcal{F}_k$,
