{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:44.552558+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f5217f350e483db79c1b9674497fb0b7e1cacf0f70abe0d231f70228f162a394","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 1 of arXiv:2604.02129, 'Realisation of constraints in underdamped Langevin dynamics'] Given $\eps>0$, let $(Q^1_t,P^1_t)$ for $i=1,2$, be the solution of~\eqref{eq:intro-Spat-Cons-Fast} with corresponding initial datum $(Q^1_0,P^1_0)$. 
