        &\mathbb P\left( \mathcal E_{\mathsf{lead}}\cap\{\mathbf X_{10} \in \cup_{(M,\delta) \in \mathfrak T_{\mathsf{mult}}}\overline{\Omega}_n(M,\delta)\}\mid E^c_{\mathsf{unique}} \right) = 1-o(1)\,.
    \end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.165871+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f5be8249531d11c8f486217fd1241ea94de237d3b327e860fa7c39f73232eb56","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2607.02777, 'Hypocoercivity for Hamiltonian Diffusions \\ with Singular Drift'] Let $f\in\ccinfty(\Omega_1)$ and $\varepsilon>0$, then
