{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.017504+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f5fdf930f926fc702c5e2ad546ff7af952cdcf61b6595d9ab17b71cfbbb7015d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:OZ of arXiv:2605.15545, 'Crossover from subcritical to critical decay: \\ random walk, self-avoiding walk, percolat'] [Ornstein--Zernike decay]

