{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:54:28.034975+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f5ff2aeed841fe2942593691745ef61392792c582dd55409c7da5483466930a6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture conj of arXiv:2608.09465, 'Balancing fractional Brownian motion'] For $a>a_0$, as $n\to\infty$, 
