{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:28.994138+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f6136dcda4a6be8fed14a0f3928e88adf797708b02ccd10561847ea61e7b163f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem g=1_rho of arXiv:2608.25362, 'Fluctuations of the free energy of the Sherrington--Kirkpatrick model with ferromagnetic i'] For $\beta > 0$ and $\gamma_N = 1 + \theta N^{-1/2}$ with $\theta \in \mathds{R}$,
