{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:48:43.600437+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f6160480b8378c68bc544bf7c1de71de9c6b563565f1c647b27ce817d5f150e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 63 of arXiv:2608.07239, 'Unified framework for asymptotically uniform iterative construction of generalised random '] For $\lambda\geq1$, we have
