{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.591288+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f646b94d1587917f830c9ded0ecf9321231b64690a2f65a0a1bbbb59714fa562","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm stochconv-(sub)crit of arXiv:2509.15790, 'Covariance matrices of volume power functionals of random simplicial complexes -- an asymp'] Let $t\delta_t^d \rightarrow 0$ and $(k,\alpha_1), (k,\alpha_2)$ be an admissible sequence with $4\alpha_i >-d+k-1$ for $i\in \{1,2\}$. Then 
