 \rho_L\Bigg(\bigg\{  \inf_{x_0 \in \mathbb{T}_{L}, \theta \in [0,2\pi] } \| \phi-e^{i\theta}\eta(x-x_0)LQ(L(\cdot-x_0)) \|_{L^2(\mathbb{T}_L)} \ge  \delta L^{\frac 12}    \bigg\}\Bigg)\lesssim e^{-cL^3},
