{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.330996+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f66ba545d03c48ec5d33c0c09c3f7e56831edf1ececf693e88c4f423bb4335ba","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition p:basiccap of arXiv:2605.20587, 'Persistence and entropic repulsion of stationary Gaussian fields with spectral singularity'] For every compact $D$,
