{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.866000+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f6dd482c65162d3876a903e5e94dcf4c888d9880ab299e7146b675cdb3503ac4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor exampleone of arXiv:2411.00629, '\Large Transformation of Stochastic Recursions and Critical Phenomena in the Analysis of t'] {}
