{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.561802+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f6f3ca8efa902463a697d86a46d84e61ba3e0141025a334eae9c239005fe0026","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 32 of arXiv:2608.26068, 'All once-extended 3D TQFTs are Reshetikhin--Turaev theories'] The following properties of $\tau$ hold.
