    \sum_{\kappa\in \Nbb^n:|\kappa|=k}\frac{\left\|\Dop^\kappa f\right\|_{\Leb^p}^{p}}{\big[1+\frac{q}{2k(2-q)} \ln^{+}(\left\|\Dop^\kappa f\right\|_{\Leb^p}^{p}/\left\|\Dop^\kappa f\right\|_{\Leb^q}^{2})\big]^{kp/2}} \geq C^{\text{\rm\ref{thm:high-order-Lp-Lq-Gaussian}}}(p,q)^k \Wop^{\geq k}(f),
