{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.829532+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f74c5021a1ca2ea81eccc71d74ffbd5ab5b7913290039645a8ea2ba8aaf1a5e9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:level-two of arXiv:2606.28869, '\bfseries A General Theory of Paths:\\ \large Signatures, Jump Lifts, and Expected Signatu'] Let $c=\beta-\alpha>0$ and
