\item $G$ admits a realization of the form
\begin{equation}
G(s,p)= D+C \bigl[I-\frac{s}{2}A -\frac14 (s^2-4p)PA(I-\frac{s}{2}A)^{-1}PA\bigr]^{-1}(\frac{s}{2}+\frac14(s^2-4p)PA(I-\frac s2 A)^{-1}P)B.
