{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.249027+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f77423fbe8f0a5ca32dadd8ccd661278465a2d7833853f6d4913e20109696ae9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:A of arXiv:2607.01946, 'Second-order fluctuations for a phase transition in random partitions'] For every $T>0$, 
