{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:41:33.832180+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f79a51959fd2a0ea16c7d0ffe1e2e91e052987fa496a1e93fc5cd10cf7c31cf0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 22 (Exact rank computation) of arXiv:2604.10792, 'Variable-Length Markov Chains on Finite Quivers: Boundary-Window Identifiability, Exact De'] In the setting of \cref{ex:branching}, with parameter block $(\eta_1,\eta_2)\in(0,1)^2$:
