{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.607777+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7c36751c74819a9573e1d418ed4f4d3f6bd2f99fce6b330682b5861e7497f66","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 10 of arXiv:2607.08242, 'Convergence of random sums in non-commutative probability'] Suppose the assumptions of Theorem \ref{thm31}(ii) hold. 
