		where \(K_{d,\alpha}\) is given by (\ref{eq_m_alpha_volume_unit_ball}).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.210967+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7f2d63de710c1f4dca03e62fe5f1d4b078c966394f57d5055741d454c32fb1d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm vector-main of arXiv:2608.29018, 'Sharp Restricted Isometry Thresholds for\\ Global Minima of Rank-Restricted Matrix LASSO'] Fix integers $r_{\star}\ge1,$ $k\ge2$, and
