{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:08.852417+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f81cb429da3af066abdb38b86ac005d01d14d51fbdb08415b7670b530ca87608","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 (Ratio identities and diagonal normalization) of arXiv:2511.12623, 'The eigenvector bead process'] For $g_i,g_j\neq0$ and any $k$,
