{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:03:59.345282+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f83212e7ab54b5fee2a22da6e1650c87867711619e607ddcff4e73f751be4959","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Satz prop:ConcentrationLpBounds of arXiv:2507.08692, 'Some notes on higher order concentration of measure'] Let $r\geq 2$ and $F\in L^{1}(\mathbb{P}_\eta)$. Then
