\Vert _{L^{\infty } (\R^{2n})} \leq K 
 C^{|\alpha +\beta  |} \sqrt { \alpha ! \beta ! },\ee

  with $K>0$ and $C>0$. If $\lambda < 1/(2C^2)$ then $F\in D_{\lambda } (  \R^{2n})$. 

 ii)  Conversely, if  $F\in D_{\lambda } (  \R^{2n})$ (with $\lambda>0$)
