{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.400062+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8d14f0fd8b6969972b23ae818e1a4c59f52313f0991233144d7c593c87d50b4","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfntn 11 of arXiv:2608.31054, 'Revisiting Picard's proof of the Picard--Weber--Weck selection theorem'] For $\mathcal{D} \subseteq D(\op A_0^\ast)$, we define the collection
