{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:12.434560+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8e9ab0db4a64cce5f24dfd8b2ae62bff513a24e2789652ee558d09d465fab25","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture conj: WithoutSymmetry of arXiv:2603.26932, 'On the satisfaction frequency of spectral characterization conditions'] Let $\bM$ be uniformly distributed on $\{0,1 \}^{n\times n}$ and consider an independent uniform random vector $\zeta\in \{0,1 \}^{n\times n}$. 
