{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.171706+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8f3f3de2374efc7e3ce8103563479022c47d5fc6ef707d9bb7d8648b7bce6ff","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_TransversalityOfTheObstructionMap_Eigen of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] In the situation of (Prop_ThickenedSpaceOfZ2ZEigenSpinors_Submanifold+Submersion of the paper)
