{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:08.850741+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f93070c4196c9fd8432accfe8810b3c801730ff87e06372b96c037002198e570","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2511.11189, 'Sharp asymptotics for the maximal distance from the boundary to the nucleus of a typical P'] When \(t \rightarrow \infty\),
