{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:33:12.362136+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f94f84b6de070a3deefa45af365bea8b0a3ed4c1b986976da6b745e0ef06a34e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 (Target-domain inverse sensitivity) of arXiv:2608.29465, 'Deciding When to Decide:\\Testing Operational Suboptimality Under Distributional Shift'] Define the identified range of target-domain gaps by
