{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.091103+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f99a148d44d3b06b13807b63a0f26eb76939e196380f7e3c7d0bd2a72897f894","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 22 (Test Function $\mathbb{W}_{x}$) of arXiv:2609.03821, 'Condensation and Metastability in the Supercritical Two-Species Zero-Range Process via Res'] Fix $x\in S_{\star}$. For $u,w\ge0$ and $y\in S_{\star}\setminus\{x\}$,
