{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:18:54.361766+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f99ba56b17eb51bb568429d0675c7817515779718ba8f12296098eb0989840f8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2608.10415, 'Continuous random variables'] The gamma function is given at half-integers by
