{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.579116+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f99beccb17c02f49544127f8e49a2b21072d70e69522df72c991c7a4bb145976","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $J\subseteq [n]$, $f:\cube^n\to \Rbb$, and $t > 0$,
