{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.763932+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9a6aa0f227ce552314a8b570918bcb8083c27983bb287986185cf3abd78074a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 13 of arXiv:2604.12334, 'On additive averaging kernels for finite Markov chains'] For any subset $S \in \mathcal D$, and $P \in \mathcal{L}(\pi)$, 
