{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.224438+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9a8833576a56a366b431a5ac7ae134c2d14efd6898db601f1dafa2edc24c830","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:ChenFrankWethSphere of arXiv:2609.00324, 'Quantitative Stability for Fractional Yamabe minimizers'] There exists a constant $C=C (n,\gamma) >0$ such that
