{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.418768+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9b75bf8cb9b234d7c7f8e8f389f4078367ea8716ef638bf82887b90363c5074","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 15 of arXiv:2605.16560, 'Seasonal Statistics of Shannon Rate in a Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Cellular Network'] The marginal distribution of $H^2_{\sst \Ical}$ and $R^2_{\sst \Ical}$ are given by the Laplace transforms for any $\g, \b\geq 0$ as

