{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:52:57.712541+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9ba85c6e9ca74ff42d7a359996f90f8903abee16acea074d3bc0678e2314baa","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 (Label-noise contribution) of arXiv:2609.02728, 'Momentum in large-batch training: Polyak enlarges the critical batch size, Nesterov improv'] There exist constants $C,c_-,c_+>0$ such that if
