    Then, for any $\mathbf{x},\mathbf{y}:[0,T]\rightarrow G^{\lfloor p\rfloor}(\mathbb{R}^k)$, the homogenous $\alpha$-H\"{o}lder distance between $\mathbf{x}$ and $\mathbf{y}$ is defined as
