{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.823725+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9ce77e6332ed42494cbab12360dff9e32bdbe3f874a9d49e9d9ab5549ef1370","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:cascading of arXiv:2607.22908, 'Epidemic Phase Transitions in the Zero-Range Process'] For any $k \geq 0$,
