{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.512148+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9cff646ced7463820675a3ccf0034d8c4e311f7ddc5e1e4e328639a9c9000bd","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary strict-drop-iterates of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] Fix $n\geq 0$. Let the zeros of 
