{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.224752+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9d7efca4e88d21eca4165a219994c4d2799103b8f983a624f22ef3e8eb09cd2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Variationalppties of arXiv:2609.00324, 'Quantitative Stability for Fractional Yamabe minimizers'] For every $u \in \mathcal{B}$, the first variation of $I_{\gamma}$ on $\mathcal{B}$ is given by
