{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.011965+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9f64c25127db8b683ba58d8b690254bcf1e6f944851f9b77bb7be1b1bbc2b6b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:FlandoliGatarek of arXiv:2605.13479, '\LARGE Dean-Kawasaki Equation with Biot-Savart and Keller-Segel Interactions: Existence an'] Given $p \geqslant 2$, $\alpha < \tfrac{1}{2}$ and separable Hilbert spaces $H$ and $K$, we have, for any progressively measurable process 
