{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.246512+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9f859f1b090c47c6391fadec0dcfa33a6f48542345ff747161fceae5720e2f2","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 28 of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] [$\mathfrak{e}_{z;q},\md_z,\td_z,\te_{z;q}$]

