{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.722598+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa2000cf91bbd56cea52b2ae82a831b57a422f3586a1d632ffd3e26bacc8798c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 (Orientation of the replicon crossing) of arXiv:2608.06523, 'On the Gardner Transition in the Ising Pure $p$-Spin Glass II'] At marginality,
\begin{equation}
 \Gamma_\mu(q)-(p-1)\xi'(q)
 \E[\cosh^{-4}(M(q))e^{W_\mu(q)}]=0,

