{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.367125+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa3a26553d5f795ea75d3fc6e8f25170e4e7115aa883fb024f67ab2bf63af81e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:loc of arXiv:2607.20956, 'Sharp moduli of continuity for Gaussian fields and stochastic PDEs via correlation bounds'] Suppose (equation alphaH=3/2 of the paper), and set
    \begin{align*}
        \delta = h^{\rho\alpha} \quad \text{and} \quad
