{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.800119+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fad4524abdd4f366e50387c4198d06595439fb4f83a62b93f1536cc816116eb9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm: main of arXiv:2510.05850, 'Three-point connectivity constant for $q$-state Potts spin clusters'] For the continuum fuzzy Potts model with $q \in (1,4)$, $\kappa = 4\arccos(-\sqrt{q}/2)/\pi\in(\frac{8}{3},4)$, and parameter $r=1/q$, we have
