{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.706680+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_faf7368cac91d9270035e4b10770017e9879573d61630eadee4acef9e2afdf05","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lA2 of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] Let $r\in[2,\infty)$. Then, for any $\gamma\in [0,1]$
\begin{equation}\begin{aligned}

\mathbf{E}^{(N)}_{t_1,\dots,t_N}\Big[\sup_{t\in[t_k, t_{k+1})}\|\Delta_t^n\|^r\Big|\mathcal{F}_{t_k}\Big]
&\leq_C \|\Delta_{t_k}^n\|^r
+h_n^{r\gamma +\frac{1}{2}}(1+\|X_{t_k}^{(n)}\|^{r\gamma\chi+r}) +h_n^{r\gamma }(1 + \|X^n_{t_k}\|^{r\gamma\chi+r})\\
