\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.872948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_faf8d174f15aa1ecc45e2a4c92eeed4e0803daf97d0ac1f1ac4dfb74c57412f0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 33 (Finite-rank Schatten conversion) of arXiv:2607.16724, 'Algebraic Transfer for Operator-Valued Gaussian Chaoses: Oriented Schatten Profiles and Si'] Let $P,Q$ be finite-rank orthogonal projections and let $1\le r\le2$.
