{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:32:20.667135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb17716d2a20a09e65f88b9f3d3c1682d4acc906a3b66c0d6004ed55f74171c5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2609.00245, 'Higher-order Gaussian bounds for maximally subelliptic boundary value problems'] For \(G_1,G_2\) defined on \(\Cuben{1}\), where at least one has compact support, whenever both sides make sense, we have
