{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.618752+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb432e1d474ab63461949a1b702f47fbe000bbeb82938fd34d2f1b673ab882fd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 26 of arXiv:2609.01358, 'Regularized spectral expansion of a Rankin--Selberg period and moments'] Let $v$ be any local place of $F$. We have
