{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.728106+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb6021b2d973087b1d81c20ef9a2dc0d6b431b7840662858de88b2bdf183b153","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:2 of arXiv:2412.09290, 'Asymptotics of Harish-Chandra transform and infinitesimal freeness'] For a smooth function $f$ of $N$ variables we have
