{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.712143+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb6110bc13cf7ee33eb561a029bbd6ecbdc073d5d0d385314bb6a75ab8b59319","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 32 (Separated-support smoothing) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Let $\phi\in C_c^\infty(\R^3)$ and $\psi\in C_b^\infty(\R^3)$ satisfy
