{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.363014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fb90951ab9f782c9fb85db82614df9ae17b16a1a34ac86b714b16670c2183c59","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:strong-law of arXiv:2607.24705, 'Derangetropy Operators'] Let $g$ be real-valued and of bounded variation on the torus with
