  \end{equation}
  and where $\widetilde{\sigma}$ runs through the set of $\mathbb C^{m\times m}$-valued functions analytic and strictly contractive in $\mathbb C_r$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

