{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:38.641440+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fba3d8a44e65da79ce3951cac6a44992925baedcfd0dcebc97909f15d0a47695","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2506.18063, 'Reduced critical branching processes in non-favorable random environment \thanks{ This wor'] Assume that Conditions $B1$ and $B2$ are valid. If $
