{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.519370+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fc41c72a70b7bd4780226e14163d400e8419f0161acd4589de7881ced2ba4359","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{cor:anchored_isop_dim}
