\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.849386+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fc4af7c8b150c5d8940bb12b8009620b452e8ccbb643a2c53abc9ea275fda53f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem BurnIn:XFractionDominatesGibbsProbability of arXiv:2607.09841, 'Mixing and cutoff for the systematic scan dynamics of the mean-field ferromagnetic Potts m'] For $s \in \mathcal{S}_{q}$ and $i,j \in Q$, we have
