{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.056984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fc4da9de664ea07fc1251102885714092c5b142cf7356881935dd10650bac085","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] There is a constant $C < +\infty$ such that
