{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.998948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fc646dae24285dfc58c9b0e049785b342f453a6d5474cafc49d38ecf194526aa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Problem 30 of arXiv:2609.03403, 'Hyperpositive functions, sector bounded functions and a trace formula'] Given  matrices
