{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.432887+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fca1626e149a6417cb936db057149bc7002c25826d911247872edf04de550a38","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 4. lem: lower bound on resistance between root and outside of ball of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] [{[Kigami_12_Resistance]}] 
