holds with~$O(1)$ that is bounded uniformly in~$n\ge1$ and~$x,y\in\Lambda_n$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.661460+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fcf4779c4fbfc19520f8b12dc7bbeba063b0efa18974cf4e06bf828ded43631a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2604.23572, '2604.23572'] The mean waiting time $\E\big[W_k^{\PR}\big]$ ($k \in \K$) of
