{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.043583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fd1228988d00c0edde2d571f0ea0d1af12102f0012f99917f1c74432d2e87210","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2606.31936, 'Coupling and Maximal Inequalities for Graph-Dependent Empirical Processes'] Suppose $(N_n,d_n)$ is uniformly doubling with dimension $d$.
