{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.242167+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fd31a9ec809ba6e2b1c6a12e5b9f6b4590a3327fa5f1513fbc6a93760aaf3135","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lemma:binomial of arXiv:2608.20635, 'Minimax Optimality of Score-Entropy Discrete Diffusion'] Let $X \sim \mathrm{Binom}(n, p)$. Then for any $\delta \in (0, 1)$, 

