{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.011251+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fd33a3be00af0c5796f0c4a9620d180fc22ce791b761ece5afe88211046d9a27","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 27 of arXiv:2609.02850, 'Canonical-row Chern flow on Bott--Samelson towers:\\ realizable-volume models for Schubert'] The graph $\mathfrak C(\mathbf i,\boldsymbol\kappa,\mathbf d)$ is balanced
