        \mathbb{E}(\mathcal{\overline{W}}(s)\mathcal{\overline{W}}(t))&=\boldsymbol{\overline{W}}(s), \quad \text{for } 0\leq s\leq t, \quad \text{when $p\in[0,\widehat{p})$},\\
