{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.987616+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fd7f193b28a007eee6d09d07a26ba60333c29758a351661158440fed472456d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 55 ({\cite[Theorem 1.3) of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] {Mak24}}] 
