{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:36:49.843639+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fd9891125bbe6a301d95686d278990ca517caa72e258661059683a21874b73ab","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:dgt4-height-lower-stretched of arXiv:2609.02829, 'Quantitative explosion and percolation of the divisible sandpile'] Suppose (equation eq:dgt4-exp-moment of the paper) holds. Suppose also that there are
