{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.585147+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fda2057133b052d5e3af0111e01e7691662507ecb76e7f0eee1175c6e64eb356","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2511.01851, 'Percolation on graphs of polynomial growth is local:\\analyticity, supercritical sharpness'] The following statements are equivalent:
