{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.237176+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fda3fc402a5e3efb8bf53250974966996e79172fc4eae9b133b7f8ae82a67667","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:law_cont_pre of arXiv:2609.04140, 'The conformally invariant metric on $\CLE_4$ III:\\ uniqueness'] For each deterministic subset $S \subseteq \BR$ of Lebesgue measure zero, the subset
