{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.932255+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe43a8e66c2961f6620fbdb150d872a54cefea7ef0716e473446db58d93792ce","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_new_decomposition of arXiv:2412.05706, 'Quasi-multiplicativity and regularity for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$ and $k\ge 1$, there exist $
	\refstepcounter{newcnstcnt}
	\ensuremath{C_{\thenewcnstcnt}}(d),
	\refstepcounter{newcnstcnt}
	\ensuremath{C_{\thenewcnstcnt}}(d),
	\refstepcounter{newcnstcnt}
	\ensuremath{C_{\thenewcnstcnt}}(d,k)>0$ such that for any $M\ge \ensuremath{C_{\ref*{const_new_decompose1}}}N$, $A_0,D \subset \widetilde{B}(\frac{N}{10\ensuremath{C_{\ref*{const_new_decompose3}}} })$ and $A_1,...,A_k,D'\subset [\widetilde{B}(10\ensuremath{C_{\ref*{const_new_decompose3}}}M)]^c$, 
	\begin{equation}
	\begin{split}
		&\mathbb{P}\Big( \{A_0\xleftrightarrow{(D\cup D')}A_1,...,A_k\}\cap \{\widetilde{\mathcal{L}}_{1/2}^{D \cup D'}[N,M]\neq 0\}\Big)\\
		\le & \ensuremath{C_{\ref*{const_new_decompose2}}}\big(\frac{N}{M}\big)^{d-2}\mathbb{P}\big( A_0\xleftrightarrow{(D)}\partial B(\tfrac{N}{\ensuremath{C_{\ref*{const_new_decompose3}}} }) \big)\\
		&\cdot  \sum\nolimits_{\gamma_k \in \Upsilon_k} \prod\nolimits_{\{j_1,...,j_m\}\in \gamma_k} \mathbb{P}\big(A_{j_1}\xleftrightarrow{ (D') } ...\xleftrightarrow{ (D') } A_{j_m}\xleftrightarrow{ (D') } \partial B(\ensuremath{C_{\ref*{const_new_decompose3}}} M) \big).
