{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.970388+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe4a6b3fff7f584bf49d8ee7954cb58f19aa3d818e93f0040fc2c9ce03550152","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 8 of arXiv:2608.03273, 'On the Asymptotic of Coupled Spherical Integrals: An Operator-Valued Extension of the Free'] Suppose that $X$ is sub-exponential with parameters $(\nu,\chi)$. Then
