{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:10:05.652087+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe6c8836869e553e358573e5a6ac54f0664d3332bddf162483e2194541d73800","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 (Robust separated batch) of arXiv:2608.16701, 'Order-Sensitive Fast-Synapse Limits in Sparse Excitatory--Inhibitory Threshold--Reset Netw'] Suppose that for some $\eta>0$,
