{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.018978+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe7072091a8dccd6a0be4cb1da06b50a4a33c20cd17626249254853955808656","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:R3_integral-2 of arXiv:2605.15545, 'Crossover from subcritical to critical decay: \\ random walk, self-avoiding walk, percolat'] Let $d \ge 1$, $\varepsilon \in (0,1) $, and denote
