with $c_1 = \frac 1 8 K_{\mathrm{IR}}$ and the implicit constant depending only on $d, \zeta, M, K_{\mathrm{IR}},s_0$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

