{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:02.037031+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe9258a807046dcd61ec815e8af4851b2b6030b6ed1d9d8a4a48769c91d5f529","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn def:tree of arXiv:2601.00119, 'The largest common subtree of two random trees'] A \emph{plane tree} is a (potentially infinite) subset $t$ of $\mathcal{U}$ satisfying the following conditions:
