{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.074715+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fea3f0c1e90d68dae1613004e63a019b695be1f6f768320f8fe68cbd1391183c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6. lem: sub-aging, convergence of traps for random electrical networks of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] Under Assumption (1. assum: sub-aging, random version of the paper), it holds that 
