{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.030104+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fec3870a9b90c5b5bf4592d68ccd9d6083e74294109b393fdee13ce83770c926","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2608.26565, 'A Horizon-Free Extrinsic Penrose Inequality'] There exist admissible minimal disks $\Gamma_0\prec\Gamma_1$, constants
