{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.095886+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fec444d9251d95b53b01fd27a01b7364693806fdc21ad6f281370e6d6f00d737","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem1444 of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Assume ((init of the paper)), and let $r\ge 2$ and $p>1$. Then
