{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.966807+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fee206dda2d101414248024c30f63d7e010285f43e8a3f8d45dc4bab0eac78a6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 33 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {Marton's ATE (Theorem 1 \cite{marton2013})}


