{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:09.866186+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_feeab98bfb3a1d509b24a12a5e1ec9616a5e3f14f7d76996f1b7432f6d44ccee","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 23 of arXiv:2605.21638, 'Markov renewal theory for transfer operators and point processes on the line'] For all $x_0<0$ and bounded, local measurable $F\colon \mathbf{N} \rightarrow \R$, we have 
