{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-09T07:38:10+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fef5c93ba5c28e2461fcdb2f9fa1eb2162e2b5a304c11bdc5dfeb237788ecb0c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3.6 of arXiv:2512.19517, 'Spiking and Resetting'] For any $\delta>0$, there exists $K<\infty$ such that 
