{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.587039+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fef65d27d204ea26ffd84145cea4d31572b821cdecd22238725bc2167c6ad58a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:technical_lemma_integrability of arXiv:2602.19773, 'Regularization of a stationary point process by a stationary increments perturbation'] Let $\xi$ be a stationary and ergodic point process with finite intensity $\lambda_{\xi}$. Then, 
