{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:05:09.624034+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff150b676ae596a66fbf792080a43acc29ce7f1235902d674f6b610a11063d41","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma of inequality of the variant of arXiv:2411.03512, 'Ergodicity and Mixing of Sublinear Expectation System and Applications'] Let $(\Omega, \mathcal{H}, \hat{\mathbb{E}})$ be a sublinear expectation space. 
