{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.855958+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff2aeb8c2a40fec57678bb406cc52d5b40bc54bd176d81a9590d59826c31d5c9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 ($L^4$-energy estimate) of arXiv:2608.21014, 'The stochastic Cahn--Hilliard equation in critical spaces'] Under the assumptions and with the notation of Proposition~\ref{prop:itoformulaL4}, 
 a.s.\ for all $t\in[0,T]$
    \begin{align}
