{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.019471+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff2be9ed0891ed1f065b3873b289e7b3aadc741ad0a905fd7617b78d84cc69ef","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2609.02878, '2609.02878'] There are $o\in\cR$ and $B<\infty$ such that, with
