{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.313204+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff5e2fa660f35c759ff0ea7d34342663a84c7102f02a99bb544beab4b6976f26","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6 of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] For any $b > 0$ and $t \ge 0$,
