{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.172063+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff6bfc03e9c7c0bb6ce9377b45125af999edd0ebb9dec62c80d43fd4ea3ea81b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] Let $({\mathbf{p}},[{\mathfrak l}]) \in \mathbf{Dir} \times \mathbf{Ram}$ and $\phi,\psi \in \Gamma\paren{X{\backslash} \mathrm{Br}({\mathfrak l}), S\otimes {\mathfrak l}}$.
  \begin{enumerate}
