{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.772292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ff78c31d53a4059cb6c2d133a198b8ef0be1c062e1c863f847c97454020169ed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2607.10102, 'Dynamical mean-field limit and replica-symmetric free energy for the orthogonally-invarian'] In addition to the conditions of Lemma \ref{lemma:tti}, suppose that
\begin{equation}
