\end{equation}
for some constant $\eps>0$ and the limits $v_*,q_*$ defined in Lemma
\ref{lemma:tti}. Then:
\begin{enumerate}[(a)]
\item $r_g:[0,\infty) \to \R$ is continuous on $[0,\infty)$ and
continuously-differentiable on $(0,\infty)$, with
